Package: DrDesign
Type: Package
Title: Shiny Apps for Agricultural Experimental Data Analysis
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Saurav", family = "Singla", email = "s00singla@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Shiny workflows for agricultural experimental design, trial validation,
    analysis of variance, regression and multi-environment stability. Includes
    augmented and strip-plot trials, genetic variability, multi-trait selection,
    diversity, power planning, incomplete blocks, spatial analysis, combining
    ability, heterosis and generation-mean analysis, with downloadable reports.
